  "about": {
    "title": "About the EX Unseen Forces set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: EX Unseen Forces is a EX expansion released on 22 August 2005. It has 117 cards: 115 in the main set and 2 secret rares. There are also 100 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 115 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (215 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 217 cards, adding the 2 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
